*     FAP                                                                       
       LBL     DFPT                                                     DFPT0000
       COUNT   50                                                       DFPT0001
*      U. OF CHICAGO FLOATING POINT TRAP CIRCUIT FOR DOUBLE PRECISION   DFPT0002
       ENTRY  -(FPT)                                                    DFPT0003
       ENTRY  -FPTEST                                                   DFPT0004
       ENTRY  -FPOLD                                                    DFPT0005
       ENTRY   DPFPT                                                    DFPT0006
 DPFPT TRA     1,4                                                      DFPT0007
(FPT)  SXA     XR4,4         SAVE INDEX REGISTER 4                      DFPT0008
       STI     IND           SAVE INDICATORS                            DFPT0009
       LDI     0             ACQUIRE ERROR CODE                         DFPT0010
       LFT     64                                                       DFPT0011
       TTR     FPT4          IF CONDITION OTHER THAN UNDERFLOW, JUMP    DFPT0012
FPT1   LFT     2             IF ACC NOT INVOLVED, SKIP                  DFPT0013
       CLM                                                              DFPT0014
       LNT     6             IF ACC OVERFLOW, RETURN WITH ALL ONES      DFPT0015
       COM                   IF ACC UNDERFLOW, RETURN WITH ZERO         DFPT0016
       COM                   IF ACC NOT INVOLVED, PROCESS SAVES IT.     DFPT0017
       STO     ACC           SAVE ACC                                   DFPT0018
       LFT     6             IF OVERFLOW OR ACC INVOLVED, JUMP          DFPT0019
       TRA     FPT2          OVERFLOW OR ACC JUMP.                      DFPT0020
       LAC     0,4           PREPARE TO ACQUIRE INSTRUCTION WHICH CAUSEDDFPT0021
       CAL     -1,4          THE TRAP.  TAKE ADVANTAGE OF FACT THAT ALL DFPT0022
       ARS     24            DOUBLE PRECISION  OPS ARE ODD EXCEPT ONE.  DFPT0023
       ERA     =O4240        SINGLE PREC OPS EXCEPT ONE ARE EVEN. TEST  DFPT0024
       LBT                   FOR EXCEPTIONS.  IF DBL PREC MQ UNDERFLOW  DFPT0025
       TNZ     FPT2          HAS OCCURED, WE WILL NOT TOUCH MQ          DFPT0026
       ERA     =O4001        EXCEPTIONS DFDH (-0240) FDP (0241)         DFPT0027
       TNZ     FPT3          TO FPT3 IF DBL PREC MQ UNDERFLOW           DFPT0028
FPT2   XCA                   ACQUIRE MQ IF ANY OTHER CASE               DFPT0029
       LFT     1             SKIP IF MQ NOT INVOLVED                    DFPT0030
       CLM                   CLEAR MAGNITUDE IF INVOLVED                DFPT0031
       LNT     5             COM TWICE IF MQ NOT INVOLVED OR UNDERFLOW  DFPT0032
       COM                   COMPLEMENT ONCE IF MQ OVERFLOW             DFPT0033
       COM                                                              DFPT0034
       XCA                   RETURN MQ                                  DFPT0035
FPT3   CLA     ACC           RESTORE ACCUMULATOR                        DFPT0036
DCT    LDI     IND           RESTORE INDICATORS                         DFPT0037
XR4    AXT     **,4          RESTORE INDEX REGISTER 4                   DFPT0038
       TRA*    0             RETURN                                     DFPT0039
 FPT4  LFT     20            IF DIVIDE CHECK OCCURRED,                  DFPT0040
       TTR     DCT           RETURN                                     DFPT0041
       STI     OVFLOW        ERROR CODE FOR (EXEM)                      DFPT0042
       LFT     40            IF DOUBLE PRECISION ODD ADDRESS ERROR,     DFPT0043
       TTR     ODDER         JUMP.                                      DFPT0044
       LDI     OVFLG         OVERFLOW.   IS IT A FATAL ERROR            DFPT0045
       LFT     77777         TEST IF FPTEST CASE                        DFPT0046
       TTR     $(EXE)        NO, GET KICKED OFF.                        DFPT0047
       LDI     0             IF FPTEST CASE, RESTORE ERROR CODE         DFPT0048
FPTA1  STI     **            STORE ERROR CODE IF FPTEST CASE            DFPT0049
       TTR     FPT1          JUMP BACK TO MAIN CIRCUIT                  DFPT0050
FPTEST CLA     1,4           ACQUIRE ADDRESS OF ERROR CODE CELL         DFPT0051
       STA     FPTA1         SET ADDRESS FOR CELL.                      DFPT0052
       ZSD     OVFLG         SET FLAG TO NOT TRANSFER TO (EXE)          DFPT0053
       TTR     2,4           RETURN                                     DFPT0054
FPOLD  SXD     OVFLG,4       RESTORE OVERFLOW TO NORMAL STATUS OF       DFPT0055
       TTR     1,4           FATAL ERROR.  RETURN.                      DFPT0056
ODDER  LDI     ODFLG         DBL PREC ODD ADDRESS ERROR. SET INDICATORS DFPT0057
       TTR     $(EXE)        FOR (EXE). TRANSFER.                       DFPT0058
ODFLG  PZE     6,1                                                      DFPT0059
OVFLG  PZE     7,4,*         FLAG FOR (EXE)                             DFPT0060
ACC    BSS     1                                                        DFPT0061
 IND   BSS     1                                                        DFPT0062
       COMMON  -1                                                       DFPT0063
OVFLOW COMMON  1                                                        DFPT0064
       END                                                              DFPT0065
